Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.97,0:00:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat atas selesainya ujian!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya semester pertama selesai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Liburan musim panas\Nyang dinanti akhirnya tiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahun ini harus makan Hipparidako Meshi\Nedisi terbatas musim panas lagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harus cek bekal kereta lainnya,\Nrekam dan penyuntingan video,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan unggah video T-Tube tiap hari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kulakukan semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya sanggup unggah video tiap hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap tahunnya selalu gagal, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tahun ini yakin bisa\Ndan nambah penonton!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.81,0:00:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian terlalu terbawa suasana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kayak beda orang dari sebelum ujian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya-Yang penting semuanya\Nsudah berakhir, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada bau harum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada bunga yang mengapung!\NCantik banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.15,0:00:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau minum bareng?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, mumpung di sini, foto juga, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo semuanya lihat ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fotonya bagus, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang pernah ada benda ini, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya sadar juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini, aku mengumpulkan\Nsuvenir dari perjalanan kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada album juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, Choshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Foto pertama kita di Stasiun Ashikajima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stasiun pojok pertama Misaki, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Ini pernah kita kunjungi juga, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi mau naik kereta diesel lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini yang pergi ke Yokohama, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dilihat begini,\Nkita sudah pergi ke banyak tempat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, yang ini juga ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, lencana ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ingat ini? Yang waktu itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oleh-oleh yang ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.59,0:02:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang ini juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya, berhenti!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya datang juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku terlambat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak masalah, tapi ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi beres-beres ruang klub,\Nsampai enggak sadar sudah larut.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seberantakan apa ruangannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih telah\Nmenggunakan Jalur Seibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itu, senior terus bercerita tanpa henti.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku agak paham soal beres-beres\Nyang enggak tuntas-tuntas itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama bisa bahas kereta tanpa henti!\NMakanya, enggak selesai-selesai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:27.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, maaf, maaf.\NRasanya Misaki sudah berubah, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, dulu kamu sering semangat di awal,\Ntapi cuma bertahan 3 hari doang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, kamu bisa kerja paruh waktu\Ndan ngisi buku catatan yang ingin kamu lakukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bertemu dengan senior yang baik, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kelihatan menikmati semuanya.\NAku jadi iri sedikit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apaan, tuh? Kayak ibuku aja!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal aku ikut senang, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, karena Misaki sudah berusaha keras,\Naku juga harus semangat mempersiapkan diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh iya, kamu mau belajar ke luar negeri, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul! Aku berangkat Senin depan, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senin depan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senin depan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Belum aku kasih tahu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.19,0:05:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belum kamu kasih tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo, terus menginap barengnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, kayaknya tahun ini enggak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu... Gimana kalau berkemah,\Nbarbeku, atau pergi ke pantai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus apa lagi, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang, tahun ini enggak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma selama liburan musim panas saja, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, Misaki masih\Npunya senior-seniormu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu beda lagi ceritanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar, mau bagaimana lagi…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi masih ada waktu seminggu, kok.\NAyo kita pergi dalam waktu dekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku usahakan cari waktu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih atas kerja kerasnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk hari Sabtu minggu ini,\Nbolehkah aku mengajak Yacchan juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan itu teman masa kecilmu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya! Katanya, dia kuliah ke luar negeri\Nmulai minggu depan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.26,0:06:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga enggak keberatan!\NNanti kukabari detailnya kalau sudah pasti!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga sama sekali enggak keberatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini Yacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sa-Salam kenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Jadi, ini Yacchan\Nyang sering dibicarakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah bergabung mendadak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak apa-apa!\NMari bersenang-senang hari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon bantuannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian benar-benar enggak keberatan?\NAku agak merasa canggung.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Santai saja! Yacchan juga tahu\Nsenior di sini baik, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dari ceritamu, memang, sih...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan! Kamu 'kan bestinya Misaki,\Naku dengan senang hati menyambutmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Besti, katanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi aku enggak tahu\Napa-apa soal kereta api…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:07:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja! Aku sudah menyiapkan sesuatu\Nsupaya kamu bisa menikmatinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, jadi merepotkan kalian…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya bilang terima kasih saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul, tuh.\NSoalnya, ini memang hobi Kodama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi hati-hati, kalau menunjukkan ketertarikan,\Nnanti kamu malah direkrut masuk klub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kamu menganggapku apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan begitu! Aku bukan tipe orang yang suka\Nmemaksakan hobinya kepada orang lain, tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu kamu juga pernah mengatakan\Nhal yang sama padaku, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah kenapa aku merasa tertekan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini... Mohon bantuannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon bantuannya juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, hijau banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini Kereta Takaosan dari seri Keio 8000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desain modelnya dibuat dengan mengambil\Ninspirasi dari alam Gunung Takao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak salah, warna dasar kereta ini\Ndiambil dari versi model yang lama, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:08:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul! Warnanya dibuat seperti kereta seri 2000\Nyang dulu pernah beroperasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang-orang yang paham betul\Nsoal kereta ikut merancang proyek ini, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini percakapan maniak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo? Jangan-jangan, ilustrasinya\Nberbeda-beda di setiap gerbong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, benar juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa berarti ilustrasinya\Nberbeda-beda tergantung musim?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepat sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, lebih tepatnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada lima jenis, yaitu musim dingin,\Nmusim gugur, musim panas, musim semi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan juga rumput muda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Yang mana? Di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin yang itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.75,0:08:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keretanya mau berangkat, jadi nanti saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stasiun yang berada di ujung Jalur Keio,\NStasiun Takaosanguchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada satu hal lagi yang tercapai, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, menjauh sedikit dari pusat kota,\Nudaranya jadi jauh lebih sejuk, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,\Nfestival kembang apinya diadakan di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, bukan di sini.\NRencananya mau ajak kalian naik kereta lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kereta Api Takao Tozan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita 'kan anggota Klub Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuannya adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.67,0:09:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naik kereta gantung!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, kereta gantung itu\Njuga termasuk kereta api, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak disangka, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kereta gantung disebut "kereta tali baja",\Njadi termasuk dalam kategori kereta api.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rangkaian keretanya juga lucu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang akan kita naiki adalah Kereta Aoba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada satu lagi yang namanya Kereta Momiji,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}nanti berpapasan di tengah perjalanan kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kodama keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ekspresi bangga dirinya luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daya tarik kereta gantung\Nlebih banyak dari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita lihat interiornya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perbedaan ketinggiannya besar, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena kereta gantung Takao Tozan beroperasi\Ndi jalur kemiringan paling curam di Jepang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nuansa klasiknya juga sedikit terasa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sudah sampai di sini, naik kereta gantung\Nsudah jadi naluri seorang penggemar kereta!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Segalanya serba kereta, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya,\Njadi inilah maniak kereta...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak terasa, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya sekali jalan cuma 6 menit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi jadi pengalaman yang bagus, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, aku baru tahu kalau\Nkereta gantung termasuk kereta api.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, mendengar sesuatu yang\N"nomor satu di Jepang" terasa menarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:11:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maniak kereta itu tidak melihat kereta\Nsekadar transportasi, tapi sebagai tujuan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omongan kamu bikin aku senang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan, memang hebat!\NLangsung paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar banget, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiap jalur dan kereta punya cerita tersendiri,\Ndan ada orang yang bekerja di baliknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, iya! Cuaca panas begini, buat apa menambah\Norang yang bikin suasana makin panas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki sudah jadi mirip dengan Kodama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya sampai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kita foto\Nbuat kenang-kenangan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat, di sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}(Puncak Gunung Takao\NTaman Nasional Kuasi Meiji no Mori Mino)\NBoleh juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}(Puncak Gunung Takao\NTaman Nasional Kuasi Meiji no Mori Mino)\NOke! Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.87,0:11:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk pulangnya nanti bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:12:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di sini ada gondola juga, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, hebat, Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan cuma kereta gantung saja,\Ngondola juga termasuk kereta api, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya. Namanya jalur khusus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Secara hukum, gondola tergolong\Ndalam UU Bisnis Perkeretaapian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu enggak apa-apa, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu takut sama ketinggian?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}E-Enggak! Sama sekali bukan masalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yakin? Gondolanya lumayan tinggi, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kubilang enggak masalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau gitu, kita berpisah saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batu, gunting, kertas, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Batu, gunting, kertas.\N- Eh, tunggu dulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Da-Dasar Kodama kejam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tinggi banget, tahu!\NKa-Kakiku sampai gemetar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bilang juga apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misaki gimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:13:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya! Udaranya sejuk, terus rasanya nyaman\Nkarena menyatu dengan alam!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tangguh juga, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ca-Canggung banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh kupanggil Yacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Te-Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, Yacchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang ini manis banget, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, waktunya acara utama hari ini,\Nyaitu festival kembang api!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat sekali kamu pulih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sata!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamii! Terima kasih atas kerja kerasnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yukatanya cantik sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, Anda petugas\Nkereta ekspres Red Arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, masih ingat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih selalu\Nmenggunakan Jalur Seibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya Orihara Kodama,\Nketua Klub Tetsuryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Justru kami yang harus berterima kasih\Nkarena sudah banyak membantu Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orihara! Kamu sering naik kereta kami, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wajahmu sampai diingat, tuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku senang sekali kamu selalu\Nmenggunakan layanan kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesering itu naik kereta, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah naik berkali-kali!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga. Ini pertama kalinya\Nkita bertemu ya, Sata?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku Kawagoe Ibuki dari Kantor Konstruksi Fasilitas,\NDepartemen Teknik Sipil Kereta Seibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Salam kenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sa-Salam kenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiba-tiba menyebutkan jabatan,\Npasti membingungkan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibuki bertanggung jawab dalam pembangunan\Ngedung stasiun dan pemeliharaan fasilitas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Contohnya sudah agak lama, sih,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku pernah menangani\Nrenovasi Stasiun Seibu-Shinjuku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?! Yang bulat besar\Ndi atas gerbang tiket itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keren! Aku berpikir benda itu keren sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Proyek itu adalah pekerjaan terbesar\Nyang kutangani sejak ditempatkan di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah berusaha keras mengerjakannya.\NJadi, senang rasanya mendengarnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pahlawan di balik layar\Ndalam bidang perkeretaapian, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pro-Profesional sejati! Keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, sekarang aku mulai\Nmengerti maksud Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan?\NJunior yang menggemaskan, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ramai banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Stan yang buka juga banyak sekali, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ramai banget...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan sampai tersesat, lo, Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kamu ibuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, benar juga.\NDia enggak kelihatan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.69,0:16:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tadi dia ada di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah coba kirim pesan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak terkirim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya sinyalnya putus\Nkarena keramaian ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ke toilet? Kalau ditunggu\Nbakal kembali sendiri enggak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Semoga saja begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, bolehkah aku pergi mencari Yacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya! Sana carilah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sendirian enggak masalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya! Aku tahu luar dalam\Ntentang Yacchan, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pergi dulu, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa begini perasaan orang tua kita\Nwaktu kita merantau ke Tokyo dulu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku agak bisa memahaminya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah membuat kalian menunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Yacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak makanan yang terlihat enak, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada takoyaki dan yakisoba?\NMenu klasik festival, nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yacchan! Maaf, tolong beli\Nyakisoba untuk semua?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan beli takoyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Misaki di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}U-Usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan, Kodama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio! Bisa-bisanya kamu\Nmembuat anak baru jadi pesuruh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku minta maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus mencari Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi susah kalau ramai begini...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudah, deh. Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ushio, kamu cari tempat\Nuntuk kita dan tunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa-bisa pertunjukan\Nkembang apinya dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Laksanakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, kira-kira pergi ke mana dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, Misaki lagi meringkuk\Ndi pojokan seperti biasanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:18:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, mungkin di sudut-sudut, seperti di sebelah\Nmesin penjual otomatis. Pasti ada di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh! Para ahli Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kita coba\Ndengan cara itu dulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga. Ayo kita coba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Misaki!\N- Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.07,0:18:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ketemu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tumben sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gimana, ya? Untuk saat ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengumuman pengunjung tersesat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nakano Yayoi dari Prefektur Chiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rombongan Anda sedang menunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan ke tenda petugas\Nfestival kembang api.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, ketemu, Yacchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak bisa menemukanmu,\Njadi terpaksa pakai cara terakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tumben sekali Yacchan\Nsampai tersesat begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang tersesat, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada akhirnya,\Nkita malah dipermainkan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang enggak bisa\Nmenang melawan Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudnya apa?\NEh, kalian kok jadi akrab banget?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang tersesat itu justru Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan aku. Enggak kusangka\Nkalau situasinya jadi seperti itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Santai, ini bukan salah Misaki, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu hebat juga bisa kepikiran\Nmemanfaatkan pengumuman pengeras suara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya, aku terbiasa dipanggil\Nlewat pengumuman, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang penting, syukurlah\Ntidak terjadi apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, kalian bertiga,\Nterima kasih banyak sudah mencariku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begini,\Nsemua masalah sudah beres.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya, nanti kalian minta ditraktir\Nsama biang keladinya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia senang-senang sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kayak buka stan sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang enggak ada\Nkerjaan selain menunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus, aku sudah beli juga untuk\Nkalian semua, jadi maafin aku, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makasih banget, teman-teman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bukannya ini kebanyakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu yakin bisa menghabiskan semuanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Santai! Gampang banget!\NPerutku keroncongan, nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar! Benar!\NMisaki boleh makan juga, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enaknya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, kamu mau kuliah\Nke negara mana, Yacchan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tailan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tailan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bicara soal Tailan,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rangkaian KiHa 183 diekspor ke sana,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu dikembangkan pada masa Kereta Api\NNasional Jepang yang kini sudah dipensiunkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu kereta ini populer sebagai\NKereta Ekspres Okhotsk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetapi sekarang dicintai sebagai\Nkereta wisata milik Kereta Api Negara Tailan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, begitu, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba yakisobanya, Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bicara soal kereta api pegunungan\Nseperti yang kita naiki hari ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di Swiss ada kereta\Nbernama Kereta Api Rigi, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.51,0:20:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Swiss pepohonannya lebih sedikit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.35,0:20:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah, sudah!\NKembang apinya mau dimulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tama-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kalian semua enggak ikut bersorak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, ayo! Jangan malu, jangan malu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu, dua!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Tama-ya!\N- Tama-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kompak, dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.05,0:21:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak solid banget, deh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:22:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh, tuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.48,0:23:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga banyak pengunjung yang datang, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.80,0:23:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo! Ini Kereta Api Matsuura.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik! Empat orang dari Klub Tetsuryo, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sudah menantikan kedatangan kalian!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.73,0:23:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya, selanjutnya\Nkamp pelatihan di Kyushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Festival kembang apinya seru, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,\Nsudah berkemas untuk kamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lo? Sendok sayur\Nsama centong nasi di mana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.28,0:23:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau apa pas kamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Memang Boleh Aku Terus?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak sabar ikut kamp ke Kyushu!
